If you have Nethack 3.1.3 I'll bet that the 1 is the number of times you  
died before your final death (i.e. the number of amulets of life saving  
you went through plus one).  On my copy I get the message "You died once"  
(or whatever number of times) at the bottom of my list of intrinsics when  
I finally buy the farm.

I don't know if this is a feature in 3.1.0, 3.1.1 or 3.1.2, but it  
certainly is in my copy of 3.1.3 (along with the list of monsters  
vanquished).  A great implementation, dev team, even if it counts *all*  
monsters that die as monsters that *I* vanquished!!!


